<title>USA: Transatlantic Holdings sets 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>Transatlantic Holdings sets 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transatlantic Holdings Inc said on Thursday that it has declared a three-for-two stock split to be paid July 18, 1997, to shareholders of record June 27.</p>
<p>Transatlantic has about 22 million shares outstanding and will have about 33 million after the stock split, a company spokesman said.</p>
</text>
